<title>POLAND: BRE '96 NET RISES TO PLN 134.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>BRE '96 NET RISES TO PLN 134.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  8.90 vs   10.62</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   27.58 vs   19.62</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 36.22 vs   27.45</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	49.74 vs   38.91</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					134.93 vs  105.36</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  209.58 vs  173.07</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		331.66 vs  277.73</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     496.20 vs  371.47</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Rozwoju Eksportu</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
